# Daemon-written runtime churn — was the GIT_DIRTY noise source (war-room 2026-06-20).
# Versioning these made the watchdog's GIT_DIRTY detector fire on every relay/metric write,
# burying real source signal. They are derived/runtime; the workload owns them, not git.
queue/
meta/
state/
sessions/
.update_check
models_dev_cache.json

# Python bytecode (derived)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS
.DS_Store
models/*.onnx
models/miniLM-onnx/onnx/
